Known bugs
==========
ggpm2c ignores IO errors.
ggpm2c ignores options.
Handle all dependencies in the Makefile. Remove wildcard compilation.

Extensions
==========

Add a check for stack overflow.
Add a DNL predefined macro or do something about '\n' after macro definitions.
Add tail recursion optimisation.
Clean up usage() text.
Add a profiling target to Makefile.
Concatenate multiple files given on the command line to implement
  standard header inclusion without changing the language.
